      "side": 1,
      "message": "I know I suggested this, but technically, I think this introduces a race condition. The hook will run sometime after jumping to RW, but that means there is a window when unaligned access will still be disabled. Increasing the priority might reduce the window, but it\u0027s probably safer to have a direct call to `cpu_init` as part of the RW initialization. e.g., in [`system_run_image_copy_with_flags`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/system.c;l\u003d652-714;drc\u003d6b7917a7a9d3bbabc454cf1b335081a858f1f95d).",
      "range": {
